  "description": "<p>If fcrepo is built on WIndows using \"mvn clean install\", the fcrepo-webapp-version-jettty-console.jar creates a stack trace and freezes (the console window is not launched).</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/osmandin/67584539e42957cea683\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://gist.github.com/osmandin/67584539e42957cea683</a></p>\n\n<p>When built on mac or linux, the jar runs fine on windows.</p>\n\n<p>Refer to IRC discussion on 3/25.</p>\n",
